suboptimal routing paths.\n\n#### Next Steps:\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of these connectivity issues. This will involve examining the configurations of the switches, the OpenFlow controller, and the routing tables. Additionally, testing the management network (20.0.0.0/24) and verifying the SDN controller's functionality will be crucial.\n\nThis report highlights the abnormal behavior in the network and provides a foundation for deeper analysis.", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 5688, "output_tokens": 520, "total_tokens": 6208, "input_token_details": {"audio": 0, "cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"audio": 0, "reasoning": 0}}}
